flowchart TD
    A[Hard Link vs Symbolic Link] --> B[Hard Link]
    A --> C[Symbolic Link Symlink]
    
    B --> B1["ln source.txt hardlink.txt"]
    B --> B2[Same inode number]
    B --> B3[Same file, different name]
    B --> B4[Cannot span filesystems]
    B --> B5[Cannot link directories]
    B --> B6[File persists if original deleted]
    
    C --> C1["ln -s source.txt symlink.txt"]
    C --> C2[Different inode]
    C --> C3[Contains path string]
    C --> C4[Can span filesystems]
    C --> C5[Can link directories]
    C --> C6[Breaks if target deleted dangling]
    
    D[Use Cases] --> D1[Hard: backup, deduplication]
    D --> D2[Sym: shortcuts, paths]
    
    E[Link Count] --> E1[Inode tracks links]
    E --> E2[File deleted when count = 0]
    
    style B fill:#e8f5e8
    style C fill:#e1f5ff
